[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2885904485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106419#issuecomment-2885904485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106419","id":2885904485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sA2hl","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T07:36:52Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T07:36:52Z","body":"Labeled as bug although I feel like this is an issue of sequencing and trying to read too early. May be a documentation issue. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2885904485/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3004347686","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106419#issuecomment-3004347686","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106419","id":3004347686,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zErUm","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-25T10:56:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-25T10:56:46Z","body":"Can replicate on `v4.4.1.stable` and on `master` (987832be460f82206fcac1467e58efbd111c5241)\n\nI suspect this is mostly a documentation issue. Some assets, such as images, have to be imported by Godot before they can be loaded. What happens is that you generate a `.exr` texture, but try to load it immediately. And because this file hasn't been imported yet at the time, it fails to load.\n\nSince the import occurs in the next frame for this example, you can wait for a frame to allow the import to pick up the file:\n```gdscript\n...\n# assign the texture to the inspector\n# baked_data\nawait get_tree().process_frame # <---\nbaked_data = ResourceLoader.load( path_exr, \"\", ResourceLoader.CACHE_MODE_IGNORE )\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3004347686/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]